    "description": {
      "value": "You throw a handful of sand that transforms into jagged shards of glass. Creatures in the area take 4d6 slashing damage and must attempt a Reflex save.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target takes half damage\nFailure: The target takes full damage and 1 persistent bleed damage.\nCritical Failure: The target takes double damage and 2 persistent bleed damage."
    },
